      "title": "TEAM GUIDE | both routes are retained",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Describe the speaker and delivery in voice_description. Put only the spoken words in script. This output is final Qwen speech; LongCat is not needed.\n\nStart with a few sentences. Check names, accents, pronunciation and final words. Independent scripts may not preserve exactly the same voice.\n\nChange the seed for another take. Fixed seed + unchanged inputs reuse the cached result. WAVs, prompts and logs are saved under output/zura_voice.\n\nRun Setup_Voice_Design_Windows.cmd once on a new workstation; generation itself is offline."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Describe the speaker and delivery in voice_description. Put only the spoken words in script. This output is final Qwen speech; LongCat is not needed.\n\nStart with a few sentences. Check names, accents, pronunciation and final words. Independent scripts may not preserve exactly the same voice.\n\nChange the seed for another take. Fixed seed + unchanged inputs reuse the cached result. WAVs, prompts and logs are saved under output/zura_voice.\n\nRun Setup_Voice_Design_Windows.cmd once on a new workstation; generation itself is offline."
      },
